  "description": "Removal of all High Pressure Laminated (HPL) cladding panels, to allow installation of new cavity barriers to all vertical and horizontal compartment wall and floor lines openings (incl. windows, doors, vents); Replacement of HPL panels with minimum A2,s1-d0 fibre cement board cladding system; Removal of combustible insulation behind the HPL panels and replacement with A1 fire rated insulation; Installation of A2 fire rated breather membrane and A2 fire rated sheathing board; Removal of combustible spandrel panels from window and door sets to front and rear of building. Replacement with new fire rated PPC aluminium sandwich panel with a mineral insulation core; Inset balcony screen, to be replaced with non-combustible min, A2 fire rated cladding.\r",
